  "noi_dung": "Cho $C = 1+4+4^2+...+4^{30}$.Biết $3C+1 = 4^m$.Tìm $m$",
  "lua_chon": null,
  "dap_an": "31",
  "loi_giai": "Ta có $4C = 4(1+4+4^2+...+4^{30}) = 4^1+4^2+...+4^{31}$\nSuy ra $4C-C = (4^1+4^2+...+4^{31})-(1+4+4^2+...+4^{30})$\n$3C = 4^{31}-1$\n$3C+1 = 4^{31}$\nMà $3C+1 = 4^m \\Rightarrow 4^m = 4^{31}$\nVậy $m = 31$"
 },
